  "result": "The dependency feature is implemented. Type-check is clean and the existing 617 tests pass. A throwaway script under `/tmp` confirmed the new rules end to end: duplicate adds return the existing link, self and transitive cycles are rejected, a done gate blocks completion, closing or archiving the last open blocker notifies the assignee once, and closed→closed changes don't notify.\n\nTwo gaps to know about:\n- Archiving a project cascades to its issues without emitting `issue.archived` per issue, so those archives don't trigger unblock notifications.\n- `IssueBlockedError` is not mapped in `toAppError`, so server actions will report it as `internal_error` with its message rather than `conflict`.",
